WEBVTT

00:08:27.787 --> 00:08:31.231
how we're going to save the future
and the planet and everything else,

00:08:31.255 --> 00:08:33.596
how we young people
striking for the climate

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:34.911
are going to fix this.

00:08:35.671 --> 00:08:36.855
Usually.

00:08:38.677 --> 00:08:40.214
But this is not how this works.

00:08:40.238 --> 00:08:43.208
This is not how this crisis works.

00:08:44.223 --> 00:08:45.398
Here's a twist:

00:08:47.049 --> 00:08:52.550
today, three and a half years
after that Paris Agreement was signed,

00:08:52.574 --> 00:08:55.215
when we look at the science,

00:08:55.239 --> 00:08:58.319
we find it's still possible
to keep global warming

00:08:58.343 --> 00:08:59.915
to below two degrees --